WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
An artist's notebook.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.643
A sketchbook is an artist's notebook.

3
00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.289
It is not for best work.

4
00:00:05.449 --> 00:00:07.725
It is for gathering, trying and thinking.

5
00:00:07.885 --> 00:00:11.460
Messy tries belong in it, because they show how your ideas grew.

6
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.554
Patterns everywhere.

7
00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:16.082
Walk down any street and look for patterns.

8
00:00:16.242 --> 00:00:17.403
Bricks in rows.

9
00:00:17.563 --> 00:00:18.910
Railings in lines.

10
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.927
Arches and roof tiles in curves.

11
00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.713
Gather them in your sketchbook.

12
00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:24.760
Record it the right way.

13
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.056
Choose the best way to record each thing.

14
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:28.377
Sketch a shape.

15
00:00:28.537 --> 00:00:29.698
Rub a texture.

16
00:00:29.858 --> 00:00:30.972
Test a colour.

17
00:00:31.132 --> 00:00:33.036
Write down a sound or a feeling.

18
00:00:33.196 --> 00:00:35.936
Notes beside a sketch are called annotations.

19
00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:38.030
From sketch to print.

20
00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:40.094
A print starts in the sketchbook.

21
00:00:40.254 --> 00:00:41.415
Look and sketch.

22
00:00:41.575 --> 00:00:43.014
Add notes and colours.

23
00:00:43.174 --> 00:00:44.660
Choose your best idea.

24
00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.793
Then press it into a foam printing block, and print it.
